1
00:00:00,669 --> 00:00:04,169
(Leonard:)I'm just saying, sometimes Raj
and I feel pushed aside.

2
00:00:04,173 --> 00:00:06,643
(Raj:)Yeah. Like when you
took Sheldon to Texas

3
00:00:06,642 --> 00:00:08,212
(Raj:)and showed him all around NASA--

4
00:00:08,210 --> 00:00:10,380
(Raj:)you didn't even think
to ask me and Leonard.

5
00:00:10,379 --> 00:00:12,309
(Howard:)You know what?
You're right.

6
00:00:12,315 --> 00:00:14,115
(Howard:)I should have asked you.

7
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:16,246
(Sheldon:)Yeah, and if he does
ask you, go.

8
00:00:16,252 --> 00:00:18,082
(Sheldon:)It's amazing.

9
00:00:19,387 --> 00:00:20,817
(Howard:)Okay, and if
we're talking

10
00:00:20,823 --> 00:00:22,323
(Howard:)about being left
out of things,

11
00:00:22,325 --> 00:00:24,255
(Howard:)you guys went to Skywalker
Ranch without us.

12
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:25,730
(Sheldon:)Oh, I recommend that, too.

13
00:00:25,728 --> 00:00:28,028
(Sheldon:)That was a magical
experience!

14
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:29,460
LEONARD:
Wait a minute.

15
00:00:29,465 --> 00:00:31,665
(Leonard:)Sheldon spent a whole day
with James Earl Jones

16
00:00:31,667 --> 00:00:32,967
(Leonard:)and never told any of us.

17
00:00:32,969 --> 00:00:34,799
(Sheldon:)I sure did.

18
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:36,304
Oh, my goodness!

19
00:00:36,305 --> 00:00:39,505
(Sheldon:)Well, from Jabba's head
to ice cream with Darth Vader,

20
00:00:39,508 --> 00:00:41,708
(Sheldon:)I'm having a heck of a ride.

21
00:00:41,711 --> 00:00:42,841
(Sheldon:)Yeah, look,

22
00:00:42,845 --> 00:00:44,145
(Sheldon:)clearly, good
things happen

23
00:00:44,146 --> 00:00:45,546
(Sheldon:)when I'm in charge.

24
00:00:45,548 --> 00:00:46,878
(Sheldon:)Now, why don't

25
00:00:46,882 --> 00:00:49,782
(Sheldon:)you boys step aside,
let me knock this project out?

26
00:00:49,785 --> 00:00:50,985
(Howard:)Sheldon,

27
00:00:50,987 --> 00:00:52,157
(Leonard:)you're not in charge.

28
00:00:52,154 --> 00:00:53,524
(Leonard:)Raj is in charge.

29
00:00:53,522 --> 00:00:55,592
(Sheldon:)Leonard, who's
really in charge?

30
00:00:55,591 --> 00:01:00,191
(Sheldon:)The person in charge, or
those who put him in charge?

